/-!
# Genuine holomorphic line-bundle powers

Natural powers of variable holomorphic cocycles give native analytic line
bundles whose fibres are identified with the full algebraic tensor powers
of the original fibres.  The package includes the degree-zero product
trivialization, original-bundle and square comparisons, distribution over
tensor products, iteration and exchange of powers, and powers of actual
cross-cover gauges.  Actual section powers are holomorphic polynomial maps
of the original total spaces and coincide with full pure tensor powers.
-/
